    "https://www.uprm.edu/empleos/en/": {
      "title": "Jobs – University of Puerto Rico at Mayagüez",
      "description": "Jobs – University of Puerto Rico at Mayagüez Skip to content 259 N Blvd. Alfonso Valdés Cobián (787) 832-4040 exts. 3159, 3045 UPRM My Portal UPR menu sup en 259 N Blvd. Alfonso Valdés Cobián (787) 832-4040 exts. 3159, 3045 Jobs University of Puerto Rico at Mayagüez Home Offers Application Contact Español UPRM My Portal UPR menu sup en Home Offers Application Contact Español 259 N Blvd. Alfonso Valdés Cobián (787) 832-4040 exts. 3159, 3045 Welcome! JOBS University of Puerto Rico Mayagüez Campus ¡Antes, ahora y siempre… COLEGIO! View offers Contact Talent Pool Sign up for job opportunities with non-regular appointments. Steps for applying Rules (in Spanish) to apply for employment at the University of Puerto Rico at Mayagüez (UPRM). Job application Fill out and submit your Employment Application Form (document in Spanish). Job offers Categories Categories Select Category Announcement For Pool of Candidates-Teaching Assistant Professor Counselor I Counselor II Industrial Engineering Department Job Opportunities Animal Science Finance Geology Industrial Biotechnology Industrial Engineering Jobs Announcements Accounting Agricultural Economics and Rural Sociology Agroenvironmental Sciences Chemical Engineering Engineering Hispanic Studies Kinesiology Social Sciences Postdoctoral Fellow Psicologist II Notice of Candidate Pool – College of Engineering Announcement For Pool of Candidates-Teaching , Engineering By carmen.flores4@upr.edu March 13, 2026 College of Engineering Read more 25-16 Assistant Professor – INQU Chemical Engineering By carmen.flores4@upr.edu May 1, 2025 Department of Chemical Engineering Read more 25-09 Assistant Professor – Industrial Engineering Assistant Professor , Industrial Engineering Department By carmen.flores4@upr.edu April 24, 2025 Department of Industrial Engineering Read more 22-12 Assistant Professor Chemical Engineering – AMENDMENT Assistant Professor , Chemical Engineering , Jobs Announcements By empleos.rum September 8, 2022 Department of Chemical Engineering Read more Opportunities and benefits Explore the opportunities and benefits we offer Are you interested in being part of a team of professionals where you can develop your discipline, skills, talents and abilities? UPRM is among the most important and recognized higher education institutions in Puerto Rico. UPRM’s contribution to the training of professionals of excellence and to the development of our country is incalculable. Feel the pride and satisfaction of serving the University of Puerto Rico, Mayagüez Campus (UPRM) contributing with your talent to the excellence and quality of the services that we offer at the first educational institution in Puerto Rico. You can also enjoy benefits such as: Medical Coverage, Christmas Bonus, Ordinary Leave, Sick Leave, Paid Maternity or Paternity Leave and Retirement Benefits, among others. Opportunities for active students Work study (Spanish) Internship programs (Contact your Department) Day work Contact Name * E-mail * Telephone Message * Send message Human Resources Hiring Section Hours Monday to Friday from 7:45 am to 11:45 pm and from 1:00 pm to 4:30 pm Telephones (787) 832-4040 Exts. 3159, 3045 E-mail empleos.rum@uprm.edu Recent offers Notice of Candidate Pool – College of Engineering College of Engineering March 13, 2026 25-16 Assistant Professor – INQU Department of Chemical Engineering May 1, 2025 25-09 Assistant Professor – Industrial Engineering Department of Industrial Engineering April 24, 2025 Location Non discrimination policies University of Puerto Rico Circular 58 2004-2005 prohibits all discrimination in education, employment, and while providing services, for reasons of race, color, sex, birth, age, origin or social condition, ancestry, marital status, religious or political ideas or beliefs, gender, sexual preference, nationality, ethnic origin, veteran status of the Armed Forces or physical disability. Campus security In compliance with Public Law Number 101-542, Campus Security Law, URUM prepares an Annual Report on Security and Crime Statistics . Jobs Partnerships Accreditations Right to Know Policies Privacy Emergencies ——— Jobs Partnerships Accreditations Right to Know Policies Privacy Emergencies ——— menu inf en © 2026 Human Resources - University of Puerto Rico at Mayagüez - University of Puerto Rico . All rights reserved. Go to Top Home Offers Application Contact Español"
